    => |corr_w| decays like 1/w (bounded by 185/w): the FAR element covers L_C only to O(1/w).
    This makes S65 far-element impotence a QUANTITATIVE bound (rate 1/w), the Riesz/TV certificate.

=> correction_w is a SIGNED sum of hat1(jw); hat1 lives on short reps of C (Riesz/theta, THM-515);
   far element's harmonics miss the lattice => correction -> 0 = equidistribution (S65) PROVED-via-Fourier.
